{
  "source": "../api/pinyin4j.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "Pinyin4j - 汉语拼音",
      "name": "pinyin4j_-_汉语拼音",
      "desc": "<p><code>pinyin4j</code> 模块是对 pinyin4j 库的轻量封装, 用于将汉字转换为拼音字符串.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/pinyin4j/Pinyin4j.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">pinyin4j</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] pinyin4j",
          "name": "[@]_pinyin4j",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "pinyin4j(str, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "pinyin4j",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>pinyin4j(...)</code> 与 <a href=\"#m-of\">pinyin4j.of(...)</a> 等价.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "str"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] pinyin4j"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] of",
          "name": "[m]_of",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "of(str, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "of",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>str</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> {{<ul>\n<li><strong>separator</strong> / <strong>sep</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 分隔符, 默认空字符串</li>\n<li><strong>case</strong> / <strong>caseType</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <code>HanyuPinyinCaseType</code> } - 大小写类型</li>\n<li><strong>tone</strong> / <strong>toneType</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <code>HanyuPinyinToneType</code> } - 声调类型</li>\n<li><strong>v</strong> / <strong>vChar</strong> / <strong>vCharType</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <code>HanyuPinyinVCharType</code> } - <code>ü</code> 的输出形式</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>}}</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将字符串中的 CJK 基本汉字范围 <code>\\u4E00..\\u9FA5</code> 转为拼音; 非该范围字符原样保留. 每个字符转换后都会追加一次分隔符, 最终结果调用 <code>trim()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(pinyin4j.of(&#39;中文&#39;)); // zhongwen\nconsole.log(pinyin4j.of(&#39;中文&#39;, { sep: &#39; &#39;, tone: &#39;WITH_TONE_NUMBER&#39; }));\nconsole.log(pinyin4j.of(&#39;中文&#39;, { tone: &#39;WITH_TONE_MARK&#39; }));\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "str"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "of(str, separator)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "of",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**str** { [string](dataTypes#string) } ",
                      "name": "**str**",
                      "type": " [string](dataTypes#string) "
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**separator** { [string](dataTypes#string) } ",
                      "name": "**separator**",
                      "type": " [string](dataTypes#string) "
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [string](dataTypes#string) } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [string](dataTypes#string) "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "str"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "separator"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>第二个参数为字符串时, 会作为分隔符使用. 如果第二个参数不是字符串也不是 JavaScript 对象, 会按默认选项处理.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注意: <code>separator</code> 会追加在每个字符之后, 最后只调用 <code>trim()</code>. 因此空格分隔符会去掉尾部空格, 但 <code>-</code> 等非空白分隔符会保留在末尾.</p>\n</blockquote>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] of"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] as",
          "name": "[m]_as",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "as(str)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "as",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>str</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 带数字声调的拼音字符串</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将 <code>zhong1</code> / <code>lü4</code> / <code>nv3</code> / <code>u:3</code> 等数字声调写法转换为声调符号写法. 这是基于内置映射的片段替换器, 不会校验整串拼音; 未匹配或映射表没有的片段会保持原样.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(pinyin4j.as(&#39;zhong1wen2&#39;)); // zhōngwén\nconsole.log(pinyin4j.as(&#39;nv3&#39;)); // nǚ\nconsole.log(pinyin4j.as(&#39;u:4&#39;)); // ǜ\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "str"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] as"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "选项取值",
          "name": "选项取值",
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "case / caseType",
              "name": "case_/_casetype",
              "desc": "<p>默认 <code>LOWERCASE</code>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>LOWERCASE</code> / <code>LOW</code> / <code>L</code> / <code>0</code></li>\n<li><code>UPPERCASE</code> / <code>UP</code> / <code>U</code> / <code>1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>非法值会抛出 <code>Invalid case type</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "case / caseType"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "tone / toneType",
              "name": "tone_/_tonetype",
              "desc": "<p>默认 <code>WITHOUT_TONE</code>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>WITH_TONE_NUMBER</code> / <code>WITH_NUMBER</code> / <code>NUMBER</code> / <code>NUM</code></li>\n<li><code>WITHOUT_TONE</code> / <code>NO_TONE</code> / <code>NO</code> / <code>FALSE</code> / <code>0</code></li>\n<li><code>WITH_TONE_MARK</code> / <code>WITH_MARK</code> / <code>MARK</code> / <code>TRUE</code> / <code>1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>非法值会抛出 <code>Invalid tone type</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "tone / toneType"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "v / vChar / vCharType",
              "name": "v_/_vchar_/_vchartype",
              "desc": "<p>默认 <code>WITH_V</code>; 当 <code>toneType</code> 为 <code>WITH_TONE_MARK</code> 且没有显式设置 vChar 时, 默认改为 <code>WITH_U_UNICODE</code>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>WITH_U_AND_COLON</code> / <code>U_AND_COLON</code> / <code>U_COLON</code> / <code>U:</code></li>\n<li><code>WITH_V</code> / <code>V</code></li>\n<li><code>WITH_U_UNICODE</code> / <code>U_UNICODE</code> / <code>UNICODE</code> / <code>Ü</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>非法值会抛出 <code>Invalid v char type</code>.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "v / vChar / vCharType"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "选项取值"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "返回与边界",
          "name": "返回与边界",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>空字符串返回空字符串.</li>\n<li>单个汉字如果底层 pinyin4j 返回多个读音, 当前实现只取 <code>firstOrNull()</code>.</li>\n<li><code>of</code> 返回的是一维字符串, 不保留多音字候选结构; 需要二维候选时应使用 <a href=\"pinyin#m-convert\">pinyin.convert</a>.</li>\n<li>pinyin4j 库自身的非法格式组合异常不会被重新包装.</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "返回与边界"
        }
      ],
      "type": "module",
      "displayName": "Pinyin4j - 汉语拼音"
    }
  ]
}